program	errors/resolve_seam_must_be_blocking.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	same
expect	error
build	refused	`__saw_rt_resolve_ipv4` is declared without `blocking` here, but another declaration of the same symbol says `blocking`
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: `__saw_rt_resolve_ipv4` is declared without `blocking` here, but another declaration of the same symbol says `blocking`"
log	"  --> examples/errors/resolve_seam_must_be_blocking.saw:14:5"
log	"     |"
log	" 14 |     func __saw_rt_resolve_ipv4(host: UnsafePointer<Int8>,"
log	"     |     ^"
log	"   hint: `blocking` is part of an extern's contract (it makes every call a suspension point), so every declaration of one symbol must agree — annotate the declaration they share, or offload a distinctly-named wrapper of your own instead"
log	""
log	"1 error(s) generated"
